            "value": "In DSC 13: Goodbye, Friends, Goodbye, the Data-Sitters write tributes to Stéfan Sinclair, Scott Enderle, and Rebecca Munson, three digital humanists who died between 2020 and 2021, and argue that fundamentally, digital humanities is people.",
